Template: bitcoin-core/prune-bool
Type: boolean
Default: false
_Description: Do you want to enable pruning?
 Save storage space by pruning (deleting) old blocks 
 and keeping only a limited copy of the blockchain.

Template: bitcoin-core/prune
Type: string
_Description: Value for pruning (must be at least 550 or 0/1) in MiB:
 0 = disabled, 1 = allow manual pruning via RPC, 
 >=550 = automatically prune block files to stay under the target size in MiB.

Template: bitcoin-core/prune-bool-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure prune.
 Couldn't configure the prune setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/prune-fail
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for prune.
 Prune must be 0, 1 or superior or equal to 550.

Template: bitcoin-core/txindex
Type: boolean
Default: false
_Description: Do you want to enable transaction index?
 This is required for electrum servers and various other software.

Template: bitcoin-core/txindex-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure txindex.
 Couldn't configure the txindex setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/dbcache
Type: string
Default: 450
_Description: Value for dbcache (must be at least 4) in MiB:
 A larger cache can speed up the initial synchronization of your Bitcoin node,  
 but after the initial sync is complete, a larger cache value does not 
 significantly improve performance and may use more RAM than needed.

Template: bitcoin-core/dbcache-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure dbcache.
 Couldn't configure the dbcache setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/dbcache-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for dbcache.
 dbcache must be superior or equal to 4.

Template: bitcoin-core/bitcoinconf
Type: error
_Description: bitcoin.conf file missing, unable to interactively configure bitcoind.
 The file /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf is missing, debconf expect this file to 
 interactively configure bitcoind.

Template: bitcoin-core/rpcthreads
Type: string
Default: 64
_Description: Value for rpcthreads (must be superior or equal to 0):
 Set the number of threads to service RPC calls.

Template: bitcoin-core/rpcthreads-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for rpcthreads.
 rpcthreads must be superior or equal to 0.

Template: bitcoin-core/rpcthreads-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure rpcthreads.
 Couldn't configure the rpcthreads setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/rpcworkqueue
Type: string
Default: 64
_Description: Value for rpcworkqueue (must be superior or equal to 0):
 Set the maximum depth of the work queue to service RPC calls.

Template: bitcoin-core/rpcworkqueue-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for rpcworkqueue.
 rpcworkqueue must be superior or equal to 0.

Template: bitcoin-core/rpcworkqueue-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure rpcworkqueue.
 Couldn't configure the rpcworkqueue setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/blockmaxweight
Type: string
Default: 3985000
_Description: Value for blockmaxweight:
 Set maximum BIP141 block weight.

Template: bitcoin-core/blockmaxweight-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for blockmaxweight.
 blockmaxweight must be between 0 and 3985000.

Template: bitcoin-core/blockmaxweight-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure blockmaxweight.
 Couldn't configure the blockmaxweight setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/maxmempool
Type: string
Default: 1000
_Description: Value for maxmempool:
 Keep the transaction memory pool below <n> megabytes.

Template: bitcoin-core/maxmempool-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for maxmempool.
 maxmempool must be superior or equal to 5.

Template: bitcoin-core/maxmempool-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure maxmempool
 Couldn't configure the maxmempool setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/blockreconstructionextratxn
Type: string
Default: 1000000
_Description: Value for blockreconstructionextratxn:
 Extra transactions to keep in memory for compact block reconstructions.

Template: bitcoin-core/blockreconstructionextratxn-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for blockreconstructionextratxn.
 blockreconstructionextratxn must be superior or equal to 0.

Template: bitcoin-core/blockreconstructionextratxn-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure blockreconstructionextratxn.
 Couldn't configure the blockreconstructionextratxn setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.

Template: bitcoin-core/datacarriersize
Type: string
Default: 42
_Description: Value for datacarriersize:
 Maximum size of data in data carrier transactions to relay and mine, in bytes.

Template: bitcoin-core/datacarriersize-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for datacarriersize.
 datacarriersize must be superior or equal to 0.

Template: bitcoin-core/datacarriersize-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure datacarriersize
 Couldn't configure the datacarriersize setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in the /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf file.